    "text": "<p>The major product &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>&rsquo; formed in the given reaction is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a1860188-94ad-425e-9c5f-0c94c8c2ca61.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 106px;\" /></p>",
